{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2eba5f3e-51e2-8bcd-aa35-7f2e2d3b907f",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T10:32:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beverly Sisson",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:29:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:29:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, honey. Oh, hold on one second, I've got a pot going. Okay. I'm sorry, I'm in the middle of cooking for six of my relatives and they'll be here at noon, so I'm stirring and dialing both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:29:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, take your time. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:29:52-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the fellow who owns the place I rent, the downstairs unit, he had a tenant move out last week. And instead of doing anything about it, he just left a whole pile out on the curb. A mattress, a busted couch, a bookcase falling apart. It's been sitting there since Friday, and the trash truck came yesterday and went right by it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:30:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so bulk items left at the curb after a move-out, and they weren't picked up on the regular day. What's the address, ma'am?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 199 Bacheller Street. Fifth Ward, up past the corner store."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "199 Bacheller Street. Got it. And you said a mattress, a couch and a bookcase?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:30:32-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And a couple of bags of who knows what. Honestly, it looks terrible, and I'm the one walking past it every day, not him. I didn't put it there, and I'm not paying for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:30:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Bulk pickup usually has to be set up ahead of time, so the crew wouldn't have taken those on a regular route day. It sounds like nobody requested it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:30:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's what I figured. So how do I ask for one? A pickup, I mean. A replacement, whatever you call it, since the regular one didn't do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can put in a bulk pickup request for that address right now. Are you the owner, or is the landlord the one who should be requesting it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm a renter, dear. He's the owner. But I'm not waiting on him, he'd leave it till spring. Can you just do it under me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can take it as a report from you, yes. Let me get a few details. The items are at the curb in front of 199 Bacheller, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, right at the curb. Oh, hang on, [pause] okay, the onions are fine. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Mattress, couch, bookcase, and some bags. Can I get a callback number in case the office needs to confirm the pickup day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0195. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:55-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. The bags may need to be separated out, since the loose trash goes in with the regular pickup. The big furniture items are what the bulk crew handles. Someone should get to it within the next week or so, and I'll note that it's been out since Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:32:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week. Well, that's not great, but it's better than nothing. Will somebody tell the landlord to quit doing this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:32:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note it on the request so it's on record. For the landlord side, that would be a separate conversation, but I can write down that it was left after a move-out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:32:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine, fine. Write it down. I'd just like it gone before my relatives see it. They'll think I live in a dump."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:32:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I've got it entered, 199 Bacheller Street, bulk furniture, callback at the number you gave me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:32:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you, honey. I've got to go save my gravy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:32:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go on, have a good lunch. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:32:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
